<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Improves frontal body armor by grafting a cage made from the bones of human corpses around the chest.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.description>通过在胸部周围移植一个由人类尸体骨骼制成的笼子来提高正面防御。</TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.description>
  <!--EN: attaching bone chest cage-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.jobString>连接骨制胸笼</TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.jobString>
  <!--EN: attach chest cage-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.label>连接胸笼</TM_FleshGolem_ChestCage.label>
  <!--EN: Increases the efficiency of energy absorbed and used by the golem by 10% for digestive system added.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.description>增加10%傀儡消化系统吸收和使用能量效率。</TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.description>
  <!--EN: adding digestive organs-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.jobString>增加消化器官</TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.jobString>
  <!--EN: add digestive organs-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.label>增加消化器官</TM_FleshGolem_DigestiveOrgans.label>
  <!--EN: Increases the rate energy dispersed throughout the golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.description>增加能量在傀儡中分散的速率，每级增加20%蓄能恢复速度。</TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.description>
  <!--EN: improving muscle metabolism-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.jobString>改善肌肉代谢</TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.jobString>
  <!--EN: enhance nutrient absorption-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.label>促进营养吸收</TM_FleshGolem_EnergySynthesis.label>
  <!--EN: Inserts a pair of eyes underneath the original pair that improve vision and reduces the chance the golem can be fully blinded.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.description>在原来的一对眼睛下面插入另一对眼睛，可以提高视力并减少傀儡完全失明的可能性。</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.description>
  <!--EN: insert eyes-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.jobString>嵌入眼睛</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.jobString>
  <!--EN: insert quad-eyes-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.label>嵌入四只眼</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT1.label>
  <!--EN: Carves an eye socket into the forehead of a flesh golem that is filled with molded magicyte in the shape of an eye. Arcane symbols are etched around the eye, forming a magical link between the golem and the eye. The evil eye is able to manifest the suppressed rage of the flesh golem to curse their target with feebleness.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.description>在血肉傀儡的额头上雕刻一个眼窝，并使其被魔法原石填充，和将奥术符号蚀刻在眼睛周围，在傀儡和眼睛之间形成一种神奇的联系。邪眼能够释放血肉傀儡被压抑的愤怒，使其能虚弱地诅咒目标。</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.description>
  <!--EN: carving evil eye-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.jobString>刻邪眼</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.jobString>
  <!--EN: carve evil eye-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.label>雕刻邪眼</TM_FleshGolem_EyesT2.label>
  <!--EN: Attaches horns into the skull of a flesh golem. Horns grant the flesh golem the lethal gore attack and allows the golem to charge into battle.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Horns.description>将犄角连接到血肉傀儡的头骨中。拥有角的血肉傀儡能使用一种致命的血腥攻击，并允许傀儡冲入战斗。</TM_FleshGolem_Horns.description>
  <!--EN: attaching horns-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Horns.jobString>链接犄角</TM_FleshGolem_Horns.jobString>
  <!--EN: attach horns-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Horns.label>链接犄角</TM_FleshGolem_Horns.label>
  <!--EN: Adds a metallic bracer to the arm of a flesh golem to increase blunt damage and allow blocking.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.description>在血肉傀儡的手臂上增加一个金属护腕，以增加钝性伤害并允许格挡。</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem bracer-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.jobString>制作傀儡护腕</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.jobString>
  <!--EN: craft golem left bracer-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.label>制作傀儡左护腕</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Bracer.label>
  <!--EN: Adds a metallic cleaver to the arm of a flesh golem, enabling an AoE cutting attack and allows the golem the ability to harvest plants.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.description>在血肉傀儡的手臂上增加一把金属劈刀，傀儡能用其进行切割攻击并提高收割速度。</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem cleaver-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.jobString>制作傀儡劈刀</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.jobString>
  <!--EN: craft golem left cleaver-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.label>制作傀儡左劈刀</TM_FleshGolem_LeftArm_Cleaver.label>
  <!--EN: Grafts metal plates around the legs of a flesh golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.description>将金属板移植到血肉傀儡的腿上。</TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.description>
  <!--EN: grafting leg plates-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.jobString>移植腿护板</TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.jobString>
  <!--EN: graft leg plates-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.label>移植腿护板</TM_FleshGolem_LegPlates.label>
  <!--EN: Enhances the flesh golem by removing excess or unnecessary body parts or organs and replacing them with extra muscle tissues, sinew and bone to further shape the flesh golem into a lethal abomination. This upgrade provides the following benefits per upgrade level [1/2/3]:
Movement:	+[20%/35%/50%]
Health:		+[30%/50%/70%]

In addition, this upgrade allows the flesh golem to use their rage to tear the limbs off their enemies.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.description>通过移除多余或不必要的身体部位或器官，并用额外的肌肉组织、肌肉和骨骼替换它们，进一步将血肉傀儡塑造成致命的怪物，从而增强血肉傀儡。此升级每升级一级[1/2/3]提供以下加成：\n移速：+[20%/35%/50%]\n生命值：+[30%/50%/70%]\n\n此外，此升级允许血肉傀儡使用愤怒撕裂敌人的四肢。</TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.description>
  <!--EN: enhancing flesh golem-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.jobString>提升血肉傀儡</TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.jobString>
  <!--EN: enhance automaton biomass-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.label>提高人造肌肉质量</TM_FleshGolem_LifeStage.label>
  <!--EN: Grafts muscle tissue onto the golem to enhance strength and endurance.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.description>将肌肉组织移植到傀儡上以增强力量和耐力。</TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.description>
  <!--EN: grafting muscle tissue-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.jobString>移植肌肉组织</TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.jobString>
  <!--EN: graft muscle tissue-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.label>移植肌肉组织</TM_FleshGolem_MuscleTissue.label>
  <!--EN: Restores missing golem parts that do not require a specific upgrade.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.description>恢复没有特定升级的缺失的傀儡身体部分。</TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.description>
  <!--EN: grafting golem part-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.jobString>移植傀儡部位</TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.jobString>
  <!--EN: restore body part-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.label>恢复身体部位</TM_FleshGolem_RestorePart.label>
  <!--EN: Adds a metallic bracer to the arm of a flesh golem to increase blunt damage and allow blocking.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.description>在血肉傀儡的手臂上增加一个金属护腕，以增加钝性伤害并允许格挡。</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem bracer-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.jobString>制作傀儡护腕</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.jobString>
  <!--EN: craft golem right bracer-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.label>制作傀儡右护腕</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Bracer.label>
  <!--EN: Adds a metallic cleaver to the arm of a flesh golem, enabling an AoE cutting attack and allows the golem the ability to cut down trees.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.description>在血肉傀儡的手臂上增加一把金属劈刀，傀儡能用其进行切割攻击并提高收割速度。</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem cleaver-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.jobString>制作傀儡劈刀</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.jobString>
  <!--EN: craft golem right cleaver-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.label>制作傀儡右劈刀</TM_FleshGolem_RightArm_Cleaver.label>
  <!--EN: Grafts metal plates onto the shoulders of a flesh golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.description>将金属板移植到血肉傀儡的肩上。</TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.description>
  <!--EN: grafting shoulder plates-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.jobString>移植肩护板</TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.jobString>
  <!--EN: graft shoulder plates-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.label>移植肩护板</TM_FleshGolem_ShoulderPlates.label>
  <!--EN: Grafts a metal plate around the skull of a flesh golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.description>将金属板移植到血肉傀儡的颅上。</TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.description>
  <!--EN: grafting skull plate-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.jobString>移植颅板</TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.jobString>
  <!--EN: graft skull plate-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.label>移植颅板</TM_FleshGolem_SkullPlate.label>
  <!--EN: Improves back armor by grafting a shell made from the bones of a corpse along the spinal column of a flesh golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.description>通过沿着血肉傀儡的脊柱移植一个由尸体骨骼制成的护板来提高背部防御。</TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.description>
  <!--EN: attaching spine bone plate-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.jobString>装上骨制脊椎护板</TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.jobString>
  <!--EN: attach spine guard-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.label>装上脊椎护板</TM_FleshGolem_SpineGuard.label>
  <!--EN: Inserts tusks into the mandibles of a flesh golem.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.description>将獠牙插入血肉傀儡的下颚。</TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.description>
  <!--EN: attaching golem tusks-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.jobString>附牙</TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.jobString>
  <!--EN: attach tusks-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.label>附牙</TM_FleshGolem_Tusks.label>
  <!--EN: Increases speed and balance by grafting wings into the back of a flesh golem. These wings are not intended for flight, rather they serve the golem by helping it offset some of its considerable bulk during combat.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Wings.description>通过将翼移植到血肉傀儡的背部来提高速度性和平衡性。这些翼并非用于飞行，而是通过帮助傀儡在战斗中抵消其相当大的重量。</TM_FleshGolem_Wings.description>
  <!--EN: attaching wings-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Wings.jobString>嵌翼</TM_FleshGolem_Wings.jobString>
  <!--EN: attach wings-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Wings.label>嵌翼</TM_FleshGolem_Wings.label>
</LanguageData>
